  },
  "body": "Following https://github.com/WICG/webhid/pull/84 and https://github.com/WICG/webusb/pull/214, this PR is an attempt to provide a way for web developers to revoke permission access to a paired SerialPort.\r\n\r\n```js\r\n// Request a serial port.\r\nconst port = await navigator.serial.requestPort();\r\n\r\n// Then later... revoke permission to the serial port.\r\nawait port.forget();\r\n```\r\n\r\n@reillyeon Please have a look\r\n\r\nFIX: #132",
